    thinking: "**Analyzing Potential Duplicates**\n\nOkay, so I\'m digging into how `Date.now() * 1000 + matchIdx` might lead to duplicate keys. If elements are unshifted repeatedly in a loop, `Date.now()` might be stale, resulting in duplicated values. The key challenge lies in the potential for `Date.now()` to remain unchanged across iterations, especially when elements are unshifted. I\'m focusing on the edge cases now.\n\n\n"
