ecycle, considering all import scenarios and initial states. My strategy ensures generated IDs are always bigger than existing ones, and that any existing duplicates are corrected. The local storage self-healing loader in `App.tsx` systematically handles potential duplicate or corrupted IDs, providing robust data integrity.\n\n\n"
